commit e4abb712ce6e7d12d91a8e8129aeb8e2e4b33ea3
Author: Raymond Burt <[redacted-email]>
Date:   Sun Sep 20 03:53:20 2026 -0500

    fix(review): make the log exporter fail closed and harden close paths

    Code review found ways the chat log could go quietly wrong. The exporter
    now refuses to run without the redaction term file, reads that file
    BOM-safe, redacts before truncating so an address cut by the cap cannot
    leak, propagates read errors instead of treating the log as empty,
    refuses to overwrite a file with unfamiliar columns, keeps hand-added
    rows by giving them a stable id, and writes through a per-process temp
    file. The modal no longer closes when a text selection is dragged out
    onto the backdrop, and the reel script renders to a scratch file and has
    no unreferenced WebM fallback. Tests: 25 exporter cases.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

